    "summary": "Use it in either player's Fight phase as soon as an enemy unit picks an **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit of yours as a target; that unit is the target.\n\nFor the rest of that phase, whenever 1 of its models is **destroyed** while the unit is yet to be **selected to fight**, roll a D6, adding 1 if the model is a **CHARACTER**. On a 3+:\n\n- leave the model on the battlefield for now\n- remove it once its unit has fought or the phase ends, whichever is earlier",
